---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About" description="We have been running food experiences in Malaysia since 2010. Culinary Travel Experts is the trade-facing side of that knowledge.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-brand-800 text-white py-20 md:py-28" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(42,34,24,0.6), rgba(42,34,24,0.5)), url(https://cdn.simplyenak.com/cte-hero-about.jpg) center/cover no-repeat;">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">About</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-white max-w-2xl">About Culinary Travel Experts</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/85 max-w-3xl">We started by running food tours. Then hotels, DMCs, and food organisers kept asking us to run things for their guests. Not because they wanted to outsource. Because their guests wanted things standard suppliers couldn't deliver.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">The Story</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">From food tours to full trip design.</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-lg text-brand-700">
        <p>Simply Enak has been running food experiences in Kuala Lumpur and Penang since 2010. Walking food tours through George Town. Market visits in Chow Kit. Private eating trips for visitors who wanted more than a restaurant recommendation from their hotel concierge.</p>
        <p>Over time, something happened we did not plan for. Hotels started calling. Concierge services wanted multi-day programmes for their guests. Food organisers asked if we could build full itineraries for groups of 12, then 20, then 40. Travel agents wanted to know if we could run a 5-day eating trip across peninsular Malaysia.</p>
        <p>The trade came to us because nobody else was doing this with the level of specificity they needed. They wanted someone who could name the right stall at Pasar Borong Selayang, who knew which Kampung Baru nasi lemak vendor made their own sambal from scratch, who could explain the difference between a Nyonya kitchen and a Malay kampung kitchen in terms a guest would remember.</p>
        <p>Culinary Travel Experts was created to give that demand a dedicated channel. Same team. Same knowledge. Structured for trade partners.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">How We Work</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">Built on knowledge, not fam trips.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">15 years of eating the same places</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Thousands of meals at hundreds of stalls, restaurants, markets, and home kitchens. We know the vendors by name, the stories behind the buildings, and when a stall's quality drops because the second generation took over.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Specific, not general</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">We do not send people to "a banana leaf restaurant." We send them to the one in Brickfields where the rasam has the right balance of tamarind and pepper, and we teach them how to eat with their hands properly. The specificity is the product.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Tested by us first</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Every stop in our programme has been eaten, walked, and vetted by our founders. If a vendor's quality slips, we know. If a new place opens that is better than the old standby, we switch. We do not pull itineraries from a database.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Are -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">Who We Are</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">Meet the team.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <a href="/about/team.html" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Our Team</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Founders who test every experience personally, and guides who are food experts first, tour guides second. Meet the people behind the programmes.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Meet the team &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/about/simply-enak.html" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Simply Enak</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">The consumer-facing brand where it started. Walking food tours, heritage walks, market visits, cooking experiences, and private tours in KL and Penang.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">About Simply Enak &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-800 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold">Ready to work together?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Whether you are a hotel concierge, travel agent, DMC, or food organiser. We will build a programme that fits your clients.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact.html" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
        <a href="/partner-with-us/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-white/50 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Partner With Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
